### Description

processChatResponse handles client tool call invocations. At the moment, it receives the tool-call message from the server, then calls onToolCall, then updates the frontend.

processChatResponse does not update the frontend before calling onToolCall. Therefore, the user will not see any progress until onToolCall returns. This can create a pretty bad UX if onToolCall is very slow.

